      "value": "Looks like dem' bois got a PR in: https://github.com/ytdl-org/youtube-dl/pull/21003  Hopefully we can get an update with the new build soonish.  Not sure if they plan to wait for the next public build or not. \n\n- On a side note, it still downloaded the video even though it spat out a warning.  The client could perhaps benefit from verifying if the file is downloading or not rather than bailing on errors?",
